{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation with pca_n2000 RNA encoding in a multiprofile RNA-only model. Validation accuracy (0.519) is lower than the avgpool baseline (config_002), suggesting transformer aggregation may not improve performance in this setup. However, uncertainty remains about whether this result is specific to pca_n2000 or influenced by other latent factors, as previous evidence indicated transformer benefits in scvi_n200 models."
}

